WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.869
-Chrissy, you and I --
-Oh, my gosh.

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.637
-You and I were talking
a few days ago

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.672
about your appearance tonight,
and I said, "You know,

00:00:06.672 --> 00:00:08.707
we could talk about your
cookbook, about having a kid,

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:10.076
all that type of stuff."
-Uh-huh.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.877
-And then as a joke,
I started asking you some

00:00:11.877 --> 00:00:13.813
very personal questions
that I would never be able

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:15.515
to ask you on TV.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.083
But then I said,
"Is there a world

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:18.451
where you could
even answer these?"

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.320
And you had
a great comeback line.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.855
Do you remember what you said?
-Yes.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.324
I said,
"I will tell you the answers

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.726
as long as people
don't know the question."

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:28.727
-And that is genius.
-[ Laughs ] Thank you.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:31.430
-So I said, "Okay, that works."
Which brings us to a new game.

00:00:31.430 --> 00:00:33.933
This is "Loaded Questions."
Here we go.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.167
♪♪

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:39.605
-♪ Loaded, Loaded,
Loaded Questions, yeah ♪

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:40.840
-Here's how it works.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.542
We're gonna take turns
choosing a shot.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.277
Each shot sits on a coaster

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.379
which has a personal question
written on it.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.481
Neither of us have seen
these questions before.

00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.150
You will read
the question silently,

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.584
but you will give
your answer out loud.

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.851
-Okay.
-And then you will have to

00:00:52.851 --> 00:00:54.787
choose whether to share
what the question was

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:56.489
or you can take the shot
and keep it a secret.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.091
-Trembling.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.893
-Okay? All right.
-Okay.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.395
-Tonight, America is finally
going to get all the answers,

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.462
just not all the questions.

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:04.897
-This is good.
This is really good.

00:01:04.897 --> 00:01:06.866
-All right. Let's play this.
All right. Here we go.

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:08.434
Chrissy, you go first.
That's yours.

00:01:08.434 --> 00:01:10.170
-Okay.
-You don't have to do the shot.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:12.304
Just move it off the coaster
and flip it over.

00:01:12.304 --> 00:01:13.806
Well, it actually has

00:01:13.806 --> 00:01:15.575
